    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Night Runners.</strong> This warrior of Skaven enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“The clever rat does not stand where the blade is falling.”<br><em>— Thanquol</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Rusty Blade, Jagged Spear, Sling, Scurry Away!, Strength in Numbers, Poisoned Throwing Stars, Warplock Pistol, Massive Boulder Throw. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
